 "turns": [
  {
   "turn": 1,
   "action": "I search the gatekeeper's desk in the gatehouse for the vault key.",
   "deltas": [
    {
     "op": "add",
     "path": "player.inventory",
     "value": "vault_key"
    }
   ],
   "narration": "You pull open the desk drawer and the vault_key is right there, cold iron with a chipped bow. Sera leans over your shoulder, counting off under her breath. \"That's the key, then. One thing done.\" She glances toward the stair beyond the door \u2014 she's heard about the man who waits there. \"Let's not dawdle. Oil doesn't wait for us.\"",
