      "text": "the Ember goes home to Harrow's Rest"
     }
    }
   ],
   "narration": "\"I promise you \u2014 the Ember goes home to Harrow's Rest,\" you say, and Sera nods once, filing it away like a debt owed. \"Heard,\" she says simply, and together you duck through the low door onto the stair_of_hooks, iron hooks glinting empty in the lantern's light. You've barely found your footing on the worn stone when a voice drifts up from the dark below, warm and unhurried. \"Well,\" says Moss, stepping into the light with his hands loose at his sides, \"you found the key. Question is what you mean to do with what's behind it.\"",
