   "narration": "You hold out the Ember, and Sera's hands close around it like it's the most fragile thing she's ever touched. \"I've got it,\" she says, tucking it close against her coat, voice steadying with every word. \"Straight down the stair, gatehouse, then home \u2014 just like you promised.\" She glances toward the vault door, already thinking of Moss waiting below. \"Stay close with that lantern. I'd rather not learn what's down here in the dark.\"",
